  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\n[This](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#inner-navigate-event-firing-algorithm:~:text=If%20event%27s%20interception%20state%20is%20%22none%22%2C%20then%20return%20true) early return will make `onnavigateerror` and `onnavigatesuccess` only ever fire when `NavigateEvent.intercept` has been called (i.e interception state is not none). This was regressed by issue #11987.",
